        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have launched new product features such as Secure Boot, which are being designed to provide additional integrity assurance of the firmware and software running on our hardware platform by establishing an encrypted key-based chain-of-trust relationship in the boot process.",
        "start_character": 44772,
        "end_character": 45061
      },
      {
