        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we develop our product roadmap and continue to expand our relationships with these and other merchant silicon vendors, it is critical that we work in tandem with our key vendors to ensure that their silicon includes improved features and that our products take advantage of such improved features.",
