        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Utilizing technology brought forward from our ongoing Digital Transformation project, which has entailed integrating digital technology into all areas of our business, changing how we operate and deliver value to customers.",
        "start_character": 47056,
        "end_character": 47279
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to regulatory developments, including SEC disclosure regulations relating to so-called \"conflict minerals,\" relating to ethically responsible sourcing of the components and materials used in our products.",
        "start_character": 56799,
        "end_character": 57023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to various environmental and other regulations governing product safety, materials usage, packaging and other environmental impacts in the United States and in various countries where our products are manufactured and sold.",
        "start_character": 56560,
        "end_character": 56798
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that continued success in the marketplace relies on our ability to regularly bring to the market new and enhanced products employing leading-edge technology that provide business solutions affordably, securely, and effortlessly.",
        "start_character": 48976,
        "end_character": 49215
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to develop and execute a number of marketing programs to support the sale and distribution of our products by communicating the value of our solutions to our existing and potential customers, our distribution channels, our resellers and our technology alliance partners.",
        "start_character": 40818,
        "end_character": 41100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide consultative services to improve customer productivity in all phases of the network lifecycle – planning, design, implementation, operations and optimization management.",
        "start_character": 31187,
        "end_character": 31367
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products primarily through an ecosystem of channel partners who combine our infinite enterprise vision and product portfolio consisting of cloud-driven applications, wired, wireless, management and analytics software products with their vertical specific offerings to create compelling information technology solutions for end-user customers.",
        "start_character": 33004,
        "end_character": 33358
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We utilize a global sourcing strategy that emphasizes procurement of materials and product manufacturing in competitive geographies.",
        "start_character": 42975,
        "end_character": 43107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000950170-25-109742",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000950170-25-109742-3abc826bd150f7f4",
        "accession_number": "0000950170-25-109742",
